WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:12.333
"How often do you play football?"

2
00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:14.556
"I sometimes play football.

3
00:00:14.557 --> 00:00:21.936
I play football on Wednesdays and Saturdays."

4
00:00:21.937 --> 00:00:25.212
"How often do you play baseball?"

5
00:00:25.213 --> 00:00:27.291
"I often play baseball.

6
00:00:27.292 --> 00:00:38.182
I play baseball on Wednesdays, Thursdays, Fridays, and Sundays."

7
00:00:38.183 --> 00:00:42.145
"How often do you play soccer?"

8
00:00:42.146 --> 00:00:44.250
"I always play soccer.

9
00:00:44.251 --> 00:00:51.468
I play every day."

10
00:00:51.469 --> 00:00:55.620
"How often do you play tennis?"

11
00:00:55.621 --> 00:00:58.429
"I never play tennis.

12
00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:02.155
I don’t like it."

13
00:01:02.156 --> 00:01:12.841
"Then come play with me!"
